# ------------------------------------
# Custom Exceptions (Crucial for your fix)
# ------------------------------------
# Explicitly UN-ignore the required CSS file for the build
# This line is NECESSARY if you have a broader *.css rule hidden elsewhere.
!frontend/src/index.css